            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on latest `main`.\n\nI didn't manage to (quickly) find what 'ibhagwan/fzf-lua' uses to replicate mapping, so I decided to try exactly one thing: replace `vim.fn.feedkeys()` as the way to replicate mapping with `vim.api.nvim_input()`. Thankfully it worked, because otherwise I'd probably close this as not planned.",
